\begin_layout Subsubsection
变分计算
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "subsubsec:13.2.2.4_变分计算"

\end_inset
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
获得泛函 (13.57) 后，我们即可通过变分原理自洽确定半经典密度分布
\begin_inset Foot
status collapsed
\begin_layout Plain Layout
此处的变分原理在与一般能量泛函
\begin_inset Formula $E[\rho]$
\end_inset
相联系时，并不严格等同于第 5.6.1.2 节中基于多体态矢的 Ritz 严格上界变分。
\end_layout
\end_inset
：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\delta\left( E[\rho] - \lambda\int\mathrm{d}^3 r\,\rho(\boldsymbol{r}) \right) = 0.\label{eq:13.58}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
为展示核心物理图像，忽略有效质量与自旋-轨道耦合项，取能量密度泛函为：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
E[\rho] = \int\mathrm{d}^3 r\,\mathcal{E}[\rho], \quad \mathcal{E}[\rho] = \mathcal{E}_\infty(\rho) + \frac{\hbar^2}{2m}\frac{1}{36}\frac{(\boldsymbol{\nabla}\rho)^2}{\rho},\label{eq:13.59}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
在核物质饱和密度
\begin_inset Formula $\rho_0 \approx 0.14\,\text{fm}^{-3}$
\end_inset
附近将其参数化展开为不可压缩模量
\begin_inset Formula $K$
\end_inset
的形式：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\mathcal{E}_\infty(\rho) \simeq \mathcal{E}_0 + \frac{K}{18}\left(\frac{\rho-\rho_0}{\rho_0}\right)^2.\label{eq:13.61}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
变分方程直接导出密度的二阶非线性常微分方程：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\Delta\rho - \frac{1}{2}\frac{(\boldsymbol{\nabla}\rho)^2}{\rho} - \frac{18m}{\hbar^2}\rho\frac{\partial\mathcal{E}_\infty}{\partial\rho} + \frac{18m}{\hbar^2}\lambda\rho = 0.\label{eq:13.62}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
在核表面渐近区，式 (13.62) 简化为 Berg-Wilets 方程 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "BW56"
literal "true"

\end_inset
：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\Delta\sqrt{\rho} - \frac{1}{a^2}\sqrt{\rho} = 0,\label{eq:13.63}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
其球对称渐近解具有指数衰减形式：
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\rho(r) \sim \frac{1}{r^2} e^{-2r/a}.\label{eq:13.64}
\]

\end_inset

\end_layout

